BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 SFF SFF
DTSTART:20260419T200000Z
DTEND:20260419T221500Z
DTSTAMP:20260419T200000Z
UID:u3yewwKeFy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\n21 Years of Sci-Fi and Fantasy S
 horts Celebrate 21 years of spellbinding cinema at the Science Fiction and
  Fantasy Short Film Festival (SFFSFF) this April at SIFF Cinema Uptown. Fo
 r two decades\, MOPOP and SIFF have put a spotlight on visionary filmmaker
 s\, showcasing innovative short films that transport audiences to brand-ne
 w worlds. The animated and live-action shorts are carefully curated and ju
 dged by a panel of film critics. Previous selections have transcended the 
 screen\, earning international distribution\, Academy Award nominations\, 
 museum exhibitions\, and more.  Join us this spring for captivating scree
 nings\, a filmmaker Q&A\, and an awards ceremony as we celebrate 20 years 
 of groundbreaking cinema and fearless storytelling. April 18 Tickets: $22
  SIFF Members\, MOPOP Members\, Students | $24 RegularApril 18 Screenings:
  Block 1 & 2 Films April 19 Tickets: $12 SIFF Members\, MOPOP Members | $
 17 Students | $18 RegularApril 19 Screenings: Day 2 Films (Next Generation
  Filmmakers)  Day 1 Schedule: 2:30 PM - Doors Open 3 PM - Block 1 Begins 
 4:45 PM - Intermission 5:45 PM - Block 2 Begins 7:20 - Awards Ceremony & F
 ilmmaker Q&A\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/sffsff\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Exit 8
DTSTART:20260419T230000Z
DTEND:20260420T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260419T230000Z
UID:7d7aNtwOoy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nGenki Kawamura’s Dante-inspire
 d spin on Kotake Create’s cult game traps Arashi star Kazunari Ninomiya 
 in a looping\, sterile subway where one mistake resets everything. A purga
 torial thriller born from on-set collaboration\, Exit 8 fuses gameplay log
 ic with razor-sharp\, emotionally charged cinema.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/
 cinema/in-theaters/exit-8\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
