DTSTART:20260508T200000Z
DTEND:20260508T215000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T200000Z
UID:n72G6QR9C2
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nA community of Ivorian women navi
 gating the complexities of migrant life in Tunisia are forced to make diff
 icult decisions when they rescue an orphaned girl from a shipwreck.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/festival/promised-sky\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
