SUMMARY:Drunken Noodles
DTSTART:20260508T223000Z
DTEND:20260509T001000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T223000Z
UID:YBhjnAyBus
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 81 mins (1h21m)\n\nNarrative shifts\, flashbacks\, f
 olds\, and even a dash of magical realism mark this quiet examination of m
 odern queer relationships\, presenting three facets of the romantic life o
 f a young New Yorker.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/drunken-noodles\n\n
 Estimated start: 15:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Edie Arnold is a Loser
DTSTART:20260509T013000Z
DTEND:20260509T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T013000Z
UID:hGhsOnDYQJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 87 mins (1h27m)\n\nLace up your combat boots and whi
 p out that black eyeliner for Edie Arnold is a Loser\, an infectiously cha
 rming coming-of-age flick about a self-proclaimed loser starting a punk ba
 nd at her Catholic high school. Directors Kade Atwood and Megan Rico sched
 uled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/edie-arnold-is-a-loser\n\
 nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hot Water
DTSTART:20260509T040000Z
DTEND:20260509T055500Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T040000Z
UID:4A3ArnAoLq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nA Lebanese-born mother drives her
  troublesome son across the U.S. after he is expelled for fighting at scho
 ol. Along the way\, the bickering duo find common ground in this charming 
 debut-feature dramedy from Ramzi Bashour. Director Ramzi Bashour and Cinem
 atographer Alfonso Herrera-Salcedo scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.sif
 f.net/festival/hot-water\n\nEstimated start: 21:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
