DTSTART:20260513T030000Z
DTEND:20260513T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T030000Z
UID:lF7xw77cwI
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 71 mins (1h11m)\n\nTacoma-based director Zach Weintr
 aub’s fictional counterpart—also named Zach—is a burnt-out suburban 
 dad who is taken on a wild supernatural odyssey when he meets a skater kid
  at the park who reminds him of his younger\, more idealistic self. Direct
 or Zach Weintraub scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/as
 sets-and-liabilities\n\nEstimated start: 20:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
