SUMMARY:Hold Onto Me
DTSTART:20260513T193000Z
DTEND:20260513T213000Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T193000Z
UID:1qXZpAC4wx
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nIris never knew her father\, who
  left when she was a baby. But one day he comes back and Iris is smitten. 
 Can he live up to her expectations?\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/hold-
 onto-me\n\nEstimated start: 12:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
